        <section id="best-practices-in-coding"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>Best practices in coding</h2>
              <p>Best practices in programming are achieved by using a variety of principles, which may initially seem tedious and time consuming but may be advantageous long term.</p>
<p>Collectively, we refer to these practices as Devops which combines software development (Dev) and IT operations (Ops). Cluttered code can cause problems when it is further extended so this is why there are rules for writing good code.</p>
<p>Let’s have a look at this in more detail.</p>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
